  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "During the alpha period, before the \"home screen\", I used to be able to rotate, fold, and unfold the phone and the app would react perfectly. Now, folding/unfolding completely closes the app and relaunches it, both on the home screen and while in game. This means you need to start the game again and re-join whatever world you were in. \n\nI understand this issue likely affects a small percentage of users, due to the (currently) low amount of foldable users, however it would be great if I didn't need to completely restart the app and rejoin a world every time I need to put my phone away in my pocket.",
